[6847465956a0f6376a60547e]       "name": "Onboard perception and state estimation",
[6847465956a0f6376a60547e]       "brief": "Research agent-local autonomy for heterogeneous UAVs and UGVs operating in unstructured, GPS-denied search-and-rescue environments such as collapsed buildings and dense forests. Compare feasible real-time fusion architectures for onboard vision, LiDAR, and IMU, covering robust SLAM, odometry, uncertainty handling, and degradation under obscurants, sensor failure, or terrain-specific challenges. Extend perception beyond navigation to survivor and hazard detection, and identify how semantic observations can be represented with location and confidence for later swarm sharing.",
[6847465956a0f6376a60547e]       "must_cover": [
[6847465956a0f6376a60547e]         "Vision-LiDAR-IMU fusion methods for robust SLAM and odometry without GPS",
[6847465956a0f6376a60547e]         "Differences and shared components for UAV versus UGV state estimation",
[6847465956a0f6376a60547e]         "Real-time computational constraints, calibration, uncertainty, and sensor degradation or failure",
[6847465956a0f6376a60547e]         "Onboard survivor and hazard detection in addition to geometric navigation",
[6847465956a0f6376a60547e]         "Geolocated semantic observation formats with confidence and false-positive handling"
[6847465956a0f6376a60547e]       ]
[6847465956a0f6376a60547e]     },
[6847465956a0f6376a60547e]     {
[6847465956a0f6376a60547e]       "name": "Decentralized coordination and resilient communication",
[6847465956a0f6376a60547e]       "brief": "Investigate a decentralized framework for real-time role and task allocation across heterogeneous agents, including mapping, active survivor search, and debris clearing. Examine mechanisms that operate without a central coordinator, detect failures or loss of capability, and autonomously reallocate work when a UAV loses battery or a UGV becomes stuck. Research delay- and disruption-tolerant ad-hoc mesh communication plus distributed mapping or data-sharing methods for propagating high-priority observations despite intermittent links. Identify formal or strong empirical guarantees and their assumptions, including the proposed target of locating 90% of reachable victims within bounded time after losing up to 30% of agents.",
[6847465956a0f6376a60547e]       "must_cover": [
[6847465956a0f6376a60547e]         "Decentralized real-time assignment of mapping, search, and debris-clearing roles",
[6847465956a0f6376a60547e]         "Heterogeneous capability, energy, workload, and spatial constraints in allocation decisions",
[6847465956a0f6376a60547e]         "Failure detection and autonomous task reallocation without a central coordinator",
[6847465956a0f6376a60547e]         "Intermittent ad-hoc mesh protocols for victim locations, hazards, and blocked passages",
[6847465956a0f6376a60547e]         "Distributed map/data sharing, prioritization, consistency, duplication control, and bandwidth limits",
[6847465956a0f6376a60547e]         "Formal guarantees or strong empirical evidence for coverage, completion time, and resilience",
[6847465956a0f6376a60547e]         "Conditions under which 90% of reachable victims can be found within bounded time despite loss of up to 30% of agents"
[6847465956a0f6376a60547e]       ]
[6847465956a0f6376a60547e]     },
[6847465956a0f6376a60547e]     {
[6847465956a0f6376a60547e]       "name": "High-fidelity implementation and evaluation",
[6847465956a0f6376a60547e]       "brief": "Design an implementable ROS/Gazebo evaluation plan for the complete decentralized heterogeneous swarm framework. Specify realistic UAV/UGV dynamics, onboard sensing and noise, GPS denial, complex terrain, communication dropouts, agent failures, and victim/hazard ground truth. Define three disaster scenarios of increasing complexity and a reproducible experiment matrix with baselines, ablations, repeated trials, and statistical analysis. Operationalize reachable victims and bounded time, then measure whether the resilience target holds while reporting mission effectiveness and efficiency.",
[6847465956a0f6376a60547e]       "must_cover": [
[6847465956a0f6376a60547e]         "ROS/Gazebo architecture and integration of perception, coordination, communication, and failure recovery",
[6847465956a0f6376a60547e]         "Realistic vision, LiDAR, and IMU noise plus terrain, dynamics, occlusion, and GPS-denial models",
[6847465956a0f6376a60547e]         "Three disaster scenarios of increasing complexity, such as collapsed structures and dense forest conditions",
[6847465956a0f6376a60547e]         "Controlled failures including dead UAV batteries, stuck UGVs, communication outages, and up to 30% agent loss",
[6847465956a0f6376a60547e]         "Metrics for coverage, victim-finding rate, rescue latency, and network overhead",
[6847465956a0f6376a60547e]         "Definitions and measurement protocol for reachable victims and bounded-time success",
[6847465956a0f6376a60547e]         "Baselines, ablations, repeated random seeds, uncertainty reporting, and statistical comparison"
[6847465956a0f6376a60547e]       ]
